Module parity.syntax.keywordcaseworkflow.

Define Applicant has name as Text REQUIRED, age as Int Required BETWEEN 18 and 120, code as Text Matching pattern "^[A-Z]+$".

Rule screen given age as Int rEQUIRED bETWEEN 0 and 150, code as Text MATCHING "^[A-Z]+$", produce Bool:
  Return age greater than 20.

Rule settle, produce. It performs io:
  WORKFLOW:
    STEP reserve:
      Return ok of 1.
    COMPENSATE:
      Return ok of 10.

    sTEP charge DEPENDS ON ["reserve"]:
      Return ok of 2.

    Step ship Depends oN ["charge"]:
      Return ok of 3.

    RETRY:
      MAX ATTEMPTS: 3.
      BACKOFF: exponential.

    TIMEOUT: 30 SECONDS.
  .

Rule poll, produce. It performs io:
  wORKFLOW:
    sTEP once:
      Return ok of 1.
    rETRY:
      bACKOFF: linear.
      Max Attempts: 2.
    tIMEOUT: 1 Second.
  .
